  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Apogee Indigo is a cross-platform mobile application that gives retail brands a single, branded app for",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "customer loyalty, stored-value gift cards, and promotional offers — combined into one digital wallet",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "carried on the customer's phone.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The application gives customers a single, mobile-first way to create an account, load and manage a",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "stored-value balance, browse and redeem rebates and offers, locate participating stores, and carry",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "their loyalty and gift cards directly in Apple Wallet or Google Wallet — without a separate physical card.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The app was originally built on Xamarin.Forms and has since been migrated to .NET MAUI, moving the",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "mobile codebase onto Microsoft's current cross-platform framework while preserving the existing",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "backend services and business logic that power the program.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
