  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Retail and multi-location brands running loyalty and stored-value programs typically need to:",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nGive customers one place to check their loyalty and gift-card balances",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nLet customers reload a stored-value account and pay from it in-store",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nDeliver targeted rebates, promotions, and offers that drive repeat visits",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nHelp customers discover participating store locations and available products",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nMake loyalty and gift cards available inside the phone's native wallet, not a separate physical card",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "•\nKeep the mobile app reliable and current as device platforms evolve",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Running these as separate systems — a point-of-sale loyalty database, a physical gift card program, a",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "standalone promotions engine — is fragmented and hard for customers to use. Apogee Indigo",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "consolidates account management, stored value, loyalty, and offers into a single branded mobile app,",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
